{
  "_meta": {
    "purpose": "Deterministic keyword to category map for Flagly. Keys are categories from mda_mandates.json _meta.category_vocabulary.",
    "version": "1.4",
    "tie_break": "1) Phrase overrides (forced category or hard block) apply first. 2) Domain categories beat catch-all recurrent_admin (so 'installation of solar lights' → renewable_energy, not admin). 3) Among remaining hits, longest matching keyword wins (most specific). 4) If equal length, earlier category in mda_mandates._meta.category_vocabulary wins. Matching is case-insensitive substring search (short tokens use word boundaries).",
    "disambiguation": "category_exclusions: if any exclusion phrase for a category appears in the description, keyword hits for that category are ignored. Example: labour_programs is blocked when 'direct labour' or 'labour room' is present so construction-method / maternity uses do not misclassify. Location tails after along/to-link/linking are stripped before keyword matching so destination nouns do not steal the category. Action-head patterns (housing units, access road, vehicle purchase, campus road, communications campaigns) win over incidental nouns.",
    "unknown_path": "If no keyword matches, the item is unclassified. Inflated Amount and Mandate Mismatch are skipped for unclassified items. The unclassified count is reported after each run."
  },
